      "writtenOn": "2016-01-13T15:01:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "++ You might get (wrongly) called out for using CASCADE on these, but that\u0027s because we have really confusing conventions around FKs. We don\u0027t allow FKs to cross backends (for example, default_project_id does not have a FK to the resource backend), because we must assume that the other backend might not be SQL. But within a backend, standard best practices should apply (like using CASCADE here).",
      "revId": "07e8ef4e5177a9347711e038495f6bc457924b8e",
